            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.0.3</h2>
<h3>What’s new</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Get a configurable reminder when a meeting appears finished, with options to stop and save, snooze, or stop automatically.</li>
  <li>Choose between Classic and Purple app icons in Settings → General.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixes</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Keeps microphone, app audio, and screen recordings aligned more reliably during long sessions and brief capture gaps.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
